<title>THAILAND: Ekkapat Finance raises debenture offer.</title>
<headline>Ekkapat Finance raises debenture offer.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ekkapat Finance and Securities Plc said on Thursday it will issue two billion baht ($80 million) of debentures in local and foreign markets.</p>
<p>The company had previously announced a plan to issue up to one billion baht in debentures. It said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand the decision to double the offer was made at a shareholder's meeting.</p>
<p>Final details of the offer will be determined by the board.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
